ent-LavalandMobBloodMiner = blood miner
    .desc = Once a miner, now a blood-crazed maniac. All that keeps him going is an endless hunger for the hunt. Move carefully and keep your eyes open, or you will be his next victim.

ent-LavalandMobBloodMinerBuffed = enraged blood miner
    .desc = Once a miner, now a blood-crazed maniac. All that keeps him going is an endless hunger for the hunt. He is clearly furious and badly wounded.

ent-LavalandSpawnMobBloodMiner = blood miner spawner

ent-LavalandCleavingSaw = cleaving saw
    .desc = A massive telescopic saw wielded by the blood miner. Heavy, but it cuts through hide and bone alike.
